Error [jet.UseWhileWriteActive]: `values` is being changed in this call, so it can't be used again here
  --> tests/ui/ownership/nested_lambda_forms_use_the_enclosing_call_access_frame_2.jet:6:25
    |
  6 |     both(values, (() -> values.len()).call())
    |                         ^^^^^^
 Why: While something is being changed through a write parameter, nobody else may be looking at it
 Fix: Pass `values` only once, or copy first with `values.copy()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0204
